20260529.111616.813 [<ideas.........] [The default Rust clippy command is `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings -W clippy::cargo`. A pre-commit]
20260529.111617.015 [<ideas.........] [hook can be configured with a shell script that runs this command if `Cargo.toml` exists. The documentation also references]
20260529.111617.213 [<ideas.........] [this command for Rust projects. Additionally, the Makefile in the enn repository uses `cd rust && cargo clippy --all-targets]
20260529.111618.896 [<ideas.........] [--all-features -- -D warnings` for linting.]
20260529.111619.093 [<ideas.........] [The Makefile omits `-W clippy::cargo` compared to the default Rust clippy command, which includes it. The `.cursorrules`]
20260529.111619.280 [<ideas.........] [file enforces a stricter linting rule set that includes additional clippy warnings, while the current `.malvin/checks` file]
20260529.111619.425 [<ideas.........] [does not include any clippy checks at all.]
